\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.  \cf0 All my deeds in the past I know not,
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 except these ones, this present day
\par I loved the flesh and all its lust
\par I was like one of earthly kings
\par And as of now is not like the past
\par My Saviour Lord has seen and saved me.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  And now I give thanks to my Jesus
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\qj that He has blessed and saved my life
\par \pard\sl190\slmult0\qj      He whisked me from the pow'r of Satan
\par      and planted me in God's children
\par     To me, a peaceful mind it affords,
\par      I am so glad and I am very pleased.
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj 
\par \pard\fi-270\li405\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.   I know that still the flesh and the blood
\par \pard\li405\sl190\slmult0\qj and pow'r of darkness is with us;
\par that keeps me fighting on forever
\par and Jesus Christ is my helper
\par He came, to save and make atonement,
\par and He will take a good care of His child.\f1 
\par \pard\cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

